o.", "words": [{"w": "I", "start": 10.4, "end": 10.62}, {"w": "never", "start": 10.62, "end": 11.06}, {"w": "thought", "start": 11.06, "end": 11.3}, {"w": "trading", "start": 11.3, "end": 11.56}, {"w": "was", "start": 11.56, "end": 11.7}, {"w": "going", "start": 11.7, "end": 11.84}, {"w": "to", "start": 11.84, "end": 11.88}, {"w": "give", "start": 11.88, "end": 11.98}, {"w": "me", "start": 11.98, "end": 12.1}, {"w": "a", "start": 12.1, "end": 12.24}, {"w": "Lambo.", "start": 12.24, "end": 12.62}]}, {"start": 12.78, "end": 15.36, "text": "I thought we were going to be able to just be home with the family all the time.", "words": [{"w": "I", "start": 12.78, "end": 12.88}, {"w": "thought", "start": 12.88, "end": 13.04}, {"w": "we", "start": 13.04, "end": 13.22}, {"w": "were", "start": 13.22, "end": 13.28}, {"w": "going", "start": 13.28, "end": 13.4}, {"w": "to", "start": 13.4, "end": 13.46}, {"w": "be", "start": 13.46, "end": 13.58}, {"w": "able", "start": 13.58, "end": 13.7}, {"w": "to", "start": 13.7, "end": 13.8}, {"w": "just", "start": 13.8, "end": 13.96}, {"w": "be", "start": 13.96, "end": 14.18}, {"w": "home", "start": 14.18, "end": 14.42}, {"w": "with", "start": 14.42, "end": 14.6}, {"w": "the", "start": 14.6, "end": 14.68}, {"w": "family", "start": 14.68, "end": 14.9}, {"w": "all", "start": 14.9, "end": 15.12}, {"w": "the", "start": 15.12, "end": 15.22}, {"w": "time.", "start": 15.22, "end": 15.36}]}, {"start": 15.7, "end": 18.42, "text": "That was our goal with trading, is exactly what Uncle Mike was doing.", "words": [{"w": "That", "start": 15.7, "end": 15.84}, {"w": "was", "start": 15.84, "end": 16.08}, {"w": "our", "start": 16.08, "end": 16.34}, {"w": "goal", "start": 16.34, "end": 16.5}, {"w": "with", "start": 16.5, "end": 16.68}, {"w": "trading,", "start": 16.68, "end": 16.9}, {"w": "is", "start": 17.06, "end": 17.14}, {"w": "exactly", "start": 17.14, "end": 17.54}, {"w": "what", "start": 17.54, "end": 17.74}, {"w": "Uncle", "start": 17.74, "end": 17.9}, 